# Google Maps Platform API Key
# Never commit your actual .env file or API keys to version control.
GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=your_google_maps_api_key_here

# ==============================================================================
# Quickstart: Get a Free Zero-Billing Maps Demo Key (Prototyping Only)
# ==============================================================================
# 1. Open: https://mapsplatform.google.com/maps-demo-key?utm_campaign=gmp_git_agentsamples_v1.0.0
# 2. Sign in with any Google account (no billing card or Cloud project required).
# 3. Accept the Maps Demo Project Terms when prompted.
# 4. Click to generate / reveal your Maps Demo Key.
# 5. Copy the key into a local `.env` file (`cp .env.example .env`) as:
#    GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=<your-demo-key>
#
# Note: The Maps Demo Key is for prototyping only, has a daily reset limit,
# and supports Maps JavaScript API, Places API (New), Routes API, and more.
#
# For production deployments:
# - Create an API key in Google Cloud Console:
#   https://console.cloud.google.com/google/maps-apis/credentials?utm_campaign=gmp_git_agentsamples_v1.0.0
# - Enable: Maps JavaScript API, Places API (New), and Routes API.
# - Restrict your key by HTTP referrer and allowed APIs:
#   https://docs.cloud.google.com/api-keys/docs/add-restrictions-api-keys?utm_campaign=gmp_git_agentsamples_v1.0.0
